#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Package Manager Engine
#  File: package_manager_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS package manager responsible for:
#      • repository management
#      • package metadata + versioning
#      • dependency resolution
#      • installation & removal
#      • rollback snapshots
#      • signature verification
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Repositories](ca://s?q=Explain_Package_Repositories)
#    - [Metadata](ca://s?q=Explain_Package_Metadata)
#    - [Dependency Resolution](ca://s?q=Explain_Dependency_Resolution)
#    - [Installation](ca://s?q=Explain_Package_Installation)
#    - [Rollback](ca://s?q=Explain_Package_Rollback)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - add_repo(name, url, packages)
#         Registers repository.
#
#    - metadata(repo, package)
#         Fetches package metadata.
#
#    - install(repo, package)
#         Installs package + dependencies.
#
#    - remove(package)
#         Removes installed package.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Creates rollback snapshot.
#
#    - rollback(snapshot_id)
#         Restores snapshot.
#
#===============================================================================
#  PACKAGE METADATA FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "version": "1.0.3",
#      "depends": ["core.lib", "crypto.lib"],
#      "signature": "<hmac>",
#      "key": "system.master",
#      "data": <binary>
#    }
#
